# virgilio on RPi 2B: base inittab (virgilio-base) + a login shell on the
# HDMI console. The kernel prints to both consoles (cmdline.txt lists
# tty1 then ttyAMA0; /dev/console = the LAST one, so the serial
# askconsole/login.sh stays authoritative), tty1 gets an askfirst root
# shell like OpenWrt's default physical console.
::sysinit:/etc/init.d/rcS S boot
tty1::askfirst:/bin/ash --login
::askconsole:/usr/libexec/login.sh
::shutdown:/etc/init.d/rcS K shutdown
